  {
   "n": 15,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>Two concentric spherical shells carry equal and opposite uniformly charge <em>Q </em>is distributed over&nbsp;their surfaces are shown in below figure,</p>\n<p><img src=\"media/f6/f6c4f8848cc924ccc16c.png\"></p>\n<p>The electric field on the surface of the inner shell will be</p>",
